    <briefdescription>
<para>Takes <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_s_c_e_v" kindref="compound">SCEV</ref> S and <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_loop" kindref="compound">Loop</ref> L. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>For each AddRec sub-expression, use its start expression in case its <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_loop" kindref="compound">Loop</ref> is L. If it is not L then if IgnoreOtherLoops is true then use AddRec itself otherwise rewrite cannot be done. If <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_s_c_e_v" kindref="compound">SCEV</ref> contains non-invariant unknown <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_s_c_e_v" kindref="compound">SCEV</ref> rewrite cannot be done. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
